# Psychology Source Summary

This source introduces Psychology as a universal mental model—a conceptual tool for navigating complex situations through pattern and relationship recognition. It provides a mental shortcut framework for making sense of the world. Cross-referenced with Robert B. Cialdini's *Influence: The Psychology of Persuasion*.
